#: _translatorinfo.cpp:1
msgid ""
"_: NAME OF TRANSLATORS\n"
"Your names"
msgstr ""

#: _translatorinfo.cpp:3
msgid ""
"_: EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS\n"
"Your emails"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Socks"
msgstr "Socks"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "&Enable SOCKS support"
msgstr "&Socks-podpěru zaswěćić"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"Check this to enable SOCKS4 and SOCKS5 support in KDE applications and I/O "
"subsystems."
msgstr ""
"Nakřižikujće tu, jeli chceće SOCKS4- a SOCKS5-podpěru za KDE-programy a "
"zapodawanske/wudawanske podsystemy zaswěćić."

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "SOCKS Implementation"
msgstr "Socks-instalowanje"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "A&uto detect"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"If you select Autodetect, then KDE will automatically search for an "
"implementation of SOCKS on your computer."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "&NEC SOCKS"
msgstr "&NEC SOCKS"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "This will force KDE to use NEC SOCKS if it can be found."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Use &custom library"
msgstr "Šćežka ke knihowni, kotraž je na wužiwarja přiměrjena"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid ""
"Select custom if you wish to use an unlisted SOCKS library. Please note that "
"this may not always work as it depends on the API of the library which you "
"specify (below)."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "&Path:"
msgstr "&Šćežka:"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Enter the path to an unsupported SOCKS library."
msgstr "Podajće tu šćežku k Socks-knihowni, kotraž so zjawnje njepodpěruje."

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "&Dante"
msgstr "&Dante"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "This will force KDE to use Dante if it can be found."
msgstr "Tu móžeće KDE nuzować, zo wužiwa Dante, jeli jón namaka."

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Additional Library Search Paths"
msgstr "Knihowniske rjadowaki, kiž maja so přidatnje přepytować"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid ""
"Here you can specify additional directories to search for the SOCKS "
"libraries. /usr/lib, /usr/local/lib, /usr/local/socks5/lib and "
"/opt/socks5/lib are already searched by default."
msgstr ""
"Tu móžeće přidatne rjadowaki podać, w kotrychž ma so za "
"Socks-knihownjemi pytać. Jako standard pyta so w /usr/lib, /usr/local/lib, "
"/usr/local/socks5/lib a /opt/socks5/lib."

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Path"
msgstr "Šćežka"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "This is the list of additional paths that will be searched."
msgstr "Tu je lisćina přidatnych šćežkow, kotrež so přepytuja."

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "&Add"
msgstr "&Dodać"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "&Test"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "Click here to test SOCKS support."
msgstr "Stłóčće tu a wuspytajće Socks-podpěru."

#: socks.cpp:88
msgid "These changes will only apply to newly started applications."
msgstr "Změny jewja so jenož w znowa startowanych programach."

#: socks.cpp:90 socks.cpp:123 socks.cpp:128
msgid "SOCKS Support"
msgstr "Socks-podpěra"

#: socks.cpp:122
msgid "Success! SOCKS was found and initialized."
msgstr ""

#: socks.cpp:127
msgid "SOCKS could not be loaded."
msgstr ""

#: socks.cpp:266
msgid ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>This module allows you to configure KDE support for a SOCKS server or "
"proxy.</p>"
"<p>SOCKS is a protocol to traverse firewalls as described in <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>"
"If you have no idea what this is and if your system administrator doesn't "
"tell you to use it, leave it disabled.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: socks.cpp:277
msgid "kcmsocks"
msgstr "kcmsocks"

#: socks.cpp:277
msgid "KDE SOCKS Control Module"
msgstr "Kontrolny modul za Socks"

